    "description": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is one of the larger indoor saunas that we have, it seats four people comfortably. Speaking of comfort, the whole sauna is designed not only to keep you sweating and feeling good about it but also for the experience to be entirely pleasant. The comfort, look, and feel of the sauna are all relevant if you plan to use this sauna regularly to gain all of the health benefits with time.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Harvia electric heaters specifically manufactured for sauna environments are supplied with this sauna. Quality electric heaters are quiet and energy-efficient. Being reliable, durable,energy-efficient, and quiet all help in the long run.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This sauna is constructed out of natural wood panels and glass panels with plenty of illumination. Being able to see what&rsquo;s happening outside of the sauna is a great distraction. If you prefer peace and quiet, perhaps the Golden range of models would be better suited for you.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">However, this sauna with its luxurious look and feel will be your own personal retreat.</span></p>\r\n<br />Traditional Heating Technology requires: Hardwire. Hardwire is recommended, if you opt to a plug, we will send you the following plug for the BC45-E heater:",
